v25.09.08 - UDP remote. Add new AsyncUDP instance in networking for listening
            for temp. broadcast messages.  When sampling temps don't set
            invalid temperatures for remote sensors (would need timer to
            set invalid ideally).
            UPS3 heat meter - power of zero is valid.
            UDP loggging, limit msg to CONFIG_TCP_MSS size (1436 bytes)
            Reboot page restyle
v25.09.07 - UDP remote: Async_udp library needs patching to prevent call to
            ::listen() failing if the UDP task already exists
v25.09.06 - Reboot : New html for reboot, which occurs in loop thread after
            flag set from webserver.
            LG - any modbus error invalidates all register values in a sample.
            Measurement Sample.  Now has vectors for the 4 sensor types.
            Mutex protected last sample.  Sampling of sensors is independent
            of reading them.
            Debug/Message level changes to improve consistency.
            UserIO uses its own Sample instance to populate the display.
            No calls are made to sensor types to obtain additional data.
            UPS3 heat meter detects pump off condition.  If poor quality
            flow rate detected then not sent to emon (if number of PWM
            samples is < 70% of possible number, likely affected by context
            switching).
            Temperatures - remote data protected by new mutex.
v25.09.05 - Memory improvements:
               Stack size reductions (async_tcp, userIO, arduino_events)
               Map sensor type + ID to name
            Don't show LG data on OLED if sample has modbus error
v25.09.04 - Ensure manager webpage is in sync with current settings
v25.09.03 - Fix file upload, now returns to manager screen
            Fix statistics send in daily email (% calc. error)
            Only measure one sensor per sample period, record sample stats
            Oled display processing moved to separate thread
            Replaced temperature sensor mutex with sample mutex
            Debug section added to webserver for development diagnostics
            Reduced memory footprint of config to reclaim ~2kB
v25.09.02 - Display screen saver (due to some OLED's appearing to fade)
            Fix File upload return to home page, new checkbox for display screen saver
            Heat Meter and Power Meter measurements at 15s intervals
            Internal structural changes, improved separation of concerns
v25.09.01 - Rebuild due to upgrade/downgrade Arduino CLI and esp32.
            Now back to Arduino 2.3.4 and esp32 3.1.0
